// Race vocabulary: every species a creature can be played as, declared
// as an ordered entry list. Each entry carries the birth data a played
// creature merges into its rolled statistics: one statistic modifier
// per statistic (six, in vocabulary order) and the race's share of the
// hit die — the class adds its own. Load assigns each id a runtime
// handle in entry order; handles are unstable across loads (entry
// order decides them), so saved data must translate through the id
// mapping, never store raw handles.
[ ( race: "human", stat_modifiers: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], hit_die: 10 ) ]
